---
layout: layouts/base.vto
---
{{# 等幅で組んだ、端末の画面のような構成 #}}
<article class="v-terminal">
  <div class="v-terminal-window">
    <div class="v-terminal-bar">
      <span class="v-terminal-dot"></span><span class="v-terminal-dot"></span><span class="v-terminal-dot"></span>
      <span class="v-terminal-path">/hexagrams/{{ hexagram.n }}</span>
    </div>

    <div class="v-terminal-body">
      <p class="v-terminal-line"><span class="v-terminal-prompt">易 ›</span> 第{{ hexagram.n }}卦</p>

      <div class="v-terminal-id">
        {{ comp.gua({ hexagram, size: "md" }) }}
        <div>
          <h1 class="v-terminal-name">{{ hexagram.name }}</h1>
          <p class="v-terminal-sub">{{ hexagram.reading }} · {{ hexagram.english }} · {{ hexagram.binary }}</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <pre class="v-terminal-out">上卦  {{ hexagram.upper.kanji }} {{ hexagram.upper.image }}  {{ hexagram.upper.attribute }}
下卦  {{ hexagram.lower.kanji }} {{ hexagram.lower.image }}  {{ hexagram.lower.attribute }}
錯卦  {{ hexagram.opposite }}    綜卦  {{ hexagram.inverse }}    互卦  {{ hexagram.nuclear }}
要目  {{ hexagram.keywords.join(" / ") }}</pre>

      <p class="v-terminal-line"><span class="v-terminal-prompt">易 ›</span> 卦辞</p>
      {{ comp.judgment({ hexagram }) }}

      <p class="v-terminal-line"><span class="v-terminal-prompt">易 ›</span> 解説</p>
      {{ comp.commentary({ hexagram }) }}

      <p class="v-terminal-line"><span class="v-terminal-prompt">易 ›</span> 象</p>
      {{ comp.art({ hexagram, modifier: "v-terminal-art" }) }}

      <p class="v-terminal-line"><span class="v-terminal-prompt">易 ›</span> 関連する卦</p>
      {{ comp.relations({ hexagram, all: hexagrams }) }}
    </div>
  </div>
</article>
